{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783", "id": 3999779018, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s7uZ8jK", "number": 2783, "title": "Building with a non-default dialect is broken?", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-02-27T08:15:03Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-30T17:24:15Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-30T17:24:15Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi,\n\nAs an example, I am trying to build current main branch (also tried v3.15.0 with same outcome) on Linux (for the record Debian 13 on x86_64) via\n\ncmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DMAVLINK_DIALECT=development -Bbuild -S.\ncmake --build build -j8\n\nand it's broken with errors that mavlink messages are unknown, e.g. MAVLINK_MSG_ID_REMOTE_LOG_DATA_BLOCK\n\nAm I now supposed to build in a different way?\n\nIn general, when creating a custom dialect, I use a similar way as the development.xml and therefore only include common.xml. Is this the usual way to do it?\n\nThanks, best regards,\nRaymond", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3977478085", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783#issuecomment-3977478085", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783", "id": 3977478085, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7tE3_F", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-02-28T17:38:15Z", "updated_at": "2026-02-28T17:38:15Z", "body": "Oh thanks for the issue. I realize now that we now depend on ardupilotmega.xml messages for ArduPilot log streaming support: https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/pull/2728/changes#diff-1e7de1ae2d059d21e1dd75d5812d5a34b0222cef273b7c3a2af62eb747f9d20a.\n\nFor now, you either have to include ardupilotmega.xml in your dialect, or you disable the log streaming plugin by removing it from this list: https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/cpp/src/plugins.txt#L19\n\nMaybe in the future, I could just do an ifdef if the messages are available, and disable ArduPilot log streaming otherwise.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3977478085/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3979423942", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783#issuecomment-3979423942", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2783", "id": 3979423942, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7tMTDG", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-01T07:38:26Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-01T07:38:26Z", "body": "Yes, that's what I am doing now indeed, and it works well then.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https